    }
  }
}
```

This Terraform configuration sets up a Managed MSK cluster with 3 broker nodes in the `us-east-1` region, creates an MSK Connect custom plugin using a `debezium.zip` file stored in an S3 bucket, and sets up an MSK Connect connector that uses the custom plugin and connects to the MSK cluster. The configuration includes VPC, subnets, security groups, IAM roles, and necessary MSK and MSK Connect resources.

