### Description
This Terraform program creates an AWS Chime Voice Connector with encryption enabled. It also configures the streaming of the voice connector with a retention period of 5 hours, sends notifications to an SNS topic, and disables streaming to Amazon Kinesis. The program includes the necessary IAM roles and permissions to ensure proper functionality.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "chime_streaming_role" {
  name = "chime-streaming-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action = "sts:AssumeRole"
        Effect = "Allow"
        Principal = {
          Service = "chime.amazonaws.com"
        }
      }
    ]
  })
}

resource "aws_iam_policy" "chime_streaming_policy" {
  name        = "chime-streaming-policy"
  description = "Policy for Chime Voice Connector Streaming"

  policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action = [
          "kinesis:PutRecord",
          "sns:Publish"
        ]
        Effect   = "Allow"
        Resource = "*"
      }
    ]
  })
}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment" "chime_streaming_policy_attachment" {
  role       = aws_iam_role.chime_streaming_role.name
  policy_arn = aws_iam_policy.chime_streaming_policy.arn
}

resource "aws_sns_topic" "chime_streaming_notifications" {
  name = "chime-streaming-notifications"
}

resource "aws_chime_voice_connector" "voice_connector" {
  name              = "MyChimeVoiceConnector"
  require_encryption = true
}

resource "aws_chime_voice_connector_streaming" "voice_connector_streaming" {
  voice_connector_id = aws_chime_voice_connector.voice_connector.id
  data_retention     = 5
  disabled           = false

  streaming_notification_targets = [
    aws_sns_topic.chime_streaming_notifications.arn
  ]

  media_insights_configuration {
    configuration_arn = ""
    disabled          = true
  }
}
```

### Explanation
1. **Provider Configuration**: The AWS provider is configured to use the `us-west-2` region.
2. **IAM Role and Policy**: An IAM role (`chime-streaming-role`) is created with a trust policy allowing Chime to assume the role. An IAM policy (`chime-streaming-policy`) is created to allow Kinesis and SNS actions. The policy is attached to the IAM role.
3. **SNS Topic**: An SNS topic (`chime-streaming-notifications`) is created to receive streaming notifications.
4. **Chime Voice Connector**: A Chime Voice Connector (`MyChimeVoiceConnector`) is created with encryption enabled.
5. **Chime Voice Connector Streaming**: The streaming configuration for the voice connector is set up with a retention period of 5 hours, notifications sent to the SNS topic, and streaming to Kinesis disabled. The media insights configuration is also disabled.

