  cidr_ipv4         = "0.0.0.0/0"
}
```

This configuration sets up a VPC with the specified CIDR block and enables DNS support and hostnames. It then creates a security group associated with this VPC and defines ingress and egress rules allowing TCP traffic on port 80 from any IP address (`0.0.0.0/0`).
